msgid ""
"The current insecure fallback will be removed in version 3.12.0. After that "
"update, authentication will fail until the JWKS endpoint is configured."
msgstr ""
"当前不安全的回退方法将在 3.12.0 "
"版本中移除。该更新后，在配置 JWKS "
"端点之前身份验证将失败。"

