#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:262
msgid ""
"Customize the text shown on the OpenID Connect login button. Leave empty to "
"use the default text."
msgstr ""
"自定义 OpenID Connect "
"登录按钮上显示的文本。留空以使用默认文本。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:263
msgid "Login with Single Sign-On"
msgstr "使用单点登录登录"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:268
msgid "Login Button Logo"
msgstr "登录按钮徽标"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:269
msgid ""
"Optional logo displayed before the text on the OpenID Connect login button. "
"Upload or select an image from the WordPress media library."
msgstr ""
"可选徽标，显示在 OpenID Connect 登录按钮文本之前。从 "
"WordPress 媒体库上传或选择图像。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:274
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "客户端 ID"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:275
msgid ""
"The ID this client will be recognized as when connecting the to Identity "
"provider server."
msgstr "此客户端连接身份提供程序服务器时将被识别的 ID。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:282
msgid "Client Secret Key"
msgstr "客户端密钥"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:283
msgid ""
"Arbitrary secret key the server expects from this client. Can be anything, "
"but should be very unique."
msgstr ""
"服务器期望此客户端提供的任意密钥。可以是任何内容，"
"但应非常唯一。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:289
msgid "OpenID Scope"
msgstr "OpenID 范围"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:290
msgid "Space separated list of scopes this client should access."
msgstr "此客户端应访问的以空格分隔的范围列表。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:297
msgid "Login Endpoint URL"
msgstr "登录端点 URL"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:298
msgid "Identify provider authorization endpoint."
msgstr "身份提供程序授权端点。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:305
msgid "Userinfo Endpoint URL"
msgstr "用户信息端点 URL"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:306
msgid "Identify provider User information endpoint."
msgstr "身份提供程序用户信息端点。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:313
msgid "Token Validation Endpoint URL"
msgstr "令牌验证端点 URL"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:314
msgid "Identify provider token endpoint."
msgstr "身份提供程序令牌端点。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:321
msgid "End Session Endpoint URL"
msgstr "结束会话端点 URL"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:322
msgid "Identify provider logout endpoint."
msgstr "身份提供程序退出登录端点。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:329
msgid "JWKS URI"
msgstr "JWKS URI"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:330
msgid ""
"Identity provider JWKS (JSON Web Key Set) endpoint for JWT signature "
"verification. Usually found at /.well-known/jwks.json"
msgstr ""
"身份提供程序 JWKS（JSON Web Key Set）端点，用于 JWT "
"签名验证。通常位于 /.well-known/jwks.json"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:337
msgid "Issuer"
msgstr "签发者"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:338
msgid ""
"Identity provider issuer URL for JWT validation. If not set, the issuer "
"will be automatically derived from the Login Endpoint URL. Only configure "
"this if your IDP uses a different issuer than the base URL of the login "
"endpoint."
msgstr ""
"用于 JWT 验证的身份提供程序签发者 "
"URL。如果未设置，签发者将从登录端点 URL "
"自动派生。仅当您的 IdP 使用的签发者与登录端点的基 URL "
"不同时才进行配置。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:345
msgid "JWKS Cache TTL (seconds)"
msgstr "JWKS 缓存 TTL（秒）"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:346
msgid "Time in seconds to cache JWKS keys. Default: 3600 (1 hour)"
msgstr "缓存 JWKS 密钥的时间（秒）。默认：3600（1 小时）"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:352
msgid "ACR values"
msgstr "ACR 值"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:353
msgid "Use a specific defined authentication contract from the IDP - optional."
msgstr "使用 IdP 定义的特定身份验证合约 - 可选。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:359
msgid "Identity Key"
msgstr "身份密钥"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:360
msgid ""
"Where in the user claim array to find the user's identification data. "
"Possible standard values: preferred_username, name, or sub. If you're "
"having trouble, use \"sub\"."
msgstr ""
"在用户声明数组中查找用户身份数据的位置。可能的標準"
"值：preferred_username、name 或 sub。如果遇到问题，请使用 "
"\"sub\"。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:366
msgid "HTTP Request Timeout"
msgstr "HTTP 请求超时"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:367
msgid "Set the timeout for requests made to the IDP. Default value is 5."
msgstr "设置向 IdP 发出请求的超时时间。默认值为 5。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:373
msgid "Enforce Privacy"
msgstr "强制隐私"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:374
msgid "Require users be logged in to see the site."
msgstr "要求用户登录后才能查看站点。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:380
msgid "Alternate Redirect URI"
msgstr "备用重定向 URI"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:381
msgid ""
"Provide an alternative redirect route. Useful if your server is causing "
"issues with the default admin-ajax method. You must flush rewrite rules "
"after changing this setting. This can be done by saving the Permalinks "
"settings page."
msgstr ""
"提供备用重定向路由。如果您的服务器在默认 admin-ajax "
"方法上出现问题，这将很有用。更改此设置后必须刷新重"
"写规则。可以通过保存固定链接设置页面来完成。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:386
msgid "Nickname Key"
msgstr "昵称密钥"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:387
msgid ""
"Where in the user claim array to find the user's nickname. Possible "
"standard values: preferred_username, name, or sub."
msgstr ""
"在用户声明数组中查找用户昵称的位置。可能的標準值：p"
"referred_username、name 或 sub。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:393
msgid "Email Formatting"
msgstr "电子邮件格式"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:394
msgid ""
"String from which the user's email address is built. Specify \"{email}\" as "
"long as the user claim contains an email claim."
msgstr ""
"用于构建用户电子邮件地址的字符串。只要用户声明包含"
"电子邮件声明，就指定 \"{email}\"。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:400
msgid "Display Name Formatting"
msgstr "显示名称格式"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:401
msgid "String from which the user's display name is built."
msgstr "用于构建用户显示名称的字符串。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:407
msgid "Identify with User Name"
msgstr "使用用户名标识"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:408
msgid ""
"If checked, the user's identity will be determined by the user name instead "
"of the email address."
msgstr ""
"如果勾选，用户身份将由用户名而不是电子邮件地址确定"
"。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:413
msgid "State time limit"
msgstr "状态时间限制"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:414
msgid "State valid time in seconds. Defaults to 180"
msgstr "状态有效期（秒）。默认为 180"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:419
msgid "Enable Refresh Token"
msgstr "启用刷新令牌"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:420
msgid ""
"If checked, support refresh tokens used to obtain access tokens from "
"supported IDPs."
msgstr ""
"如果勾选，支持用于从受支持的 IdP "
"获取访问令牌的刷新令牌。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:425
msgid "Disable SSL Verify"
msgstr "禁用 SSL 验证"

#. translators: %1$s HTML tags for layout/styles (strong tag start with warning class), %2$s closing HTML tag for styles.
#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:427
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Do not require SSL verification during authorization. %1$sOnly works in "
"local development (WP_DEBUG=true, WP_ENVIRONMENT_TYPE=local).%2$s This "
"setting is automatically disabled in production. If you need this in "
"production, fix your SSL certificates instead."
msgstr ""
"授权期间不要求 SSL "
"验证。%1$s仅适用于本地开发（WP_DEBUG=true、WP_ENVIRONMENT_TYPE="
"local）。%2$s此设置在生产环境中会自动禁用。如果您在生"
"产环境中需要此功能，请修复您的 SSL 证书。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:432
msgid "Allow Internal IDP"
msgstr "允许内部 IdP"

#. translators: %1$s HTML tags for layout/styles (strong tag start with warning class), %2$s closing HTML tag for styles.
#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:434
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Allow HTTP requests to internal/private network endpoints (localhost, "
"127.0.0.1, 10.x.x.x, 192.168.x.x, 172.16-31.x.x). %1$sOnly enable this for "
"local development or corporate internal identity providers. Disabling SSRF "
"protection can expose your server to security risks.%2$s"
msgstr ""
"允许向内部/专用网络端点（localhost、127.0.0.1、10.x.x.x、192."
"168.x.x、172.16-31.x.x）发出 HTTP "
"请求。%1$s仅在本地开发或企业内部身份提供程序时启用。"
"禁用 SSRF 保护可能会使您的服务器面临安全风险。%2$s"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:439
msgid "Link Existing Users"
msgstr "关联现有用户"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:440
msgid ""
"If a WordPress account already exists with the same identity as a "
"newly-authenticated user over OpenID Connect, login as that user instead of "
"generating an error."
msgstr ""
"如果已存在与通过 OpenID Connect "
"新认证用户具有相同身份的 WordPress "
"账户，请以该用户身份登录，而不是生成错误。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:446
msgid "Create user if does not exist"
msgstr "如果不存在则创建用户"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:447
msgid ""
"If the user identity is not linked to an existing WordPress user, it is "
"created. If this setting is not enabled, and if the user authenticates with "
"an account which is not linked to an existing WordPress user, then the "
"authentication will fail."
msgstr ""
"如果用户身份未关联到现有的 WordPress "
"用户，则会创建该用户。如果未启用此设置，并且用户使"
"用未关联到现有 WordPress "
"用户的账户进行身份验证，则身份验证将失败。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:453
msgid "Email Domain Restriction"
msgstr "电子邮件域限制"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:454
msgid ""
"Restrict login to specific email domains or full email addresses. Enter "
"domains (e.g. \"company.com\") or full emails (e.g. \"specificuser@gmail.com\") "
"separated by spaces. Leave empty to allow all."
msgstr ""
"将登录限制为特定的电子邮件域或完整电子邮件地址。输"
"入以空格分隔的域（例如 "
"\"company.com\"）或完整电子邮件（例如 "
"\"specificuser@gmail.com\"）。留空以允许所有。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:461
msgid "Redirect Back to Origin Page"
msgstr "重定向回原始页面"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:462
msgid ""
"After a successful OpenID Connect authentication, this will redirect the "
"user back to the page on which they clicked the OpenID Connect login "
"button. This will cause the login process to proceed in a traditional "
"WordPress fashion. For example, users logging in through the default "
"wp-login.php page would end up on the WordPress Dashboard and users logging "
"in through the WooCommerce \"My Account\" page would end up on their account "
"page."
msgstr ""
"OpenID Connect 身份验证成功后，将用户重定向回他们单击 "
"OpenID Connect 登录按钮的页面。这将使登录过程以传统的 "
"WordPress 方式继续进行。例如，通过默认 wp-login.php "
"页面登录的用户最终会进入 WordPress 仪表盘，而通过 "
"WooCommerce“我的账户”页面登录的用户最终会进入其账户"
"页面。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:468
msgid "Redirect to the login screen when session is expired"
msgstr "会话过期时重定向到登录屏幕"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:469
msgid ""
"When enabled, this will automatically redirect the user back to the "
"WordPress login page if their access token has expired."
msgstr ""
"启用后，如果用户的访问令牌已过期，将自动将用户重定"
"向回 WordPress 登录页面。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:475
msgid "Bypass local 2FA on SSO login"
msgstr "SSO 登录时绕过本地 2FA"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s wrap a warning message in strong tags.
#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:478
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Skip the second-factor prompt from supported 2FA plugins when a user logs "
"in via OpenID Connect. %1$sOnly enable this when multi-factor "
"authentication is enforced at the identity provider.%2$s"
msgstr ""
"当用户通过 OpenID Connect 登录时，跳过受支持的 2FA "
"插件的第二因素提示。%1$s仅在身份提供程序强制执行多重"
"身份验证时才启用此项。%2$s"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:484
msgid "None (do not bypass)"
msgstr "无（不绕过）"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:485
msgid "Admin and Site Enhancements (ASE)"
msgstr "Admin and Site Enhancements (ASE)"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:486
msgid "WP 2FA - Two-factor authentication (Melapress)"
msgstr "WP 2FA - Two-factor authentication (Melapress)"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:492
msgid "Enable Logging"
msgstr "启用日志记录"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:493
msgid "Very simple log messages for debugging purposes."
msgstr "用于调试的非常简单的日志消息。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:499
msgid "Log Limit"
msgstr "日志限制"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:500
msgid ""
"Number of items to keep in the log. These logs are stored as an option in "
"the database, so space is limited."
msgstr ""
"日志中保留的项目数。这些日志作为选项存储在数据库中"
"，因此空间有限。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:593
msgid "Choose Login Button Logo"
msgstr "选择登录按钮徽标"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:594
msgid "Use this image"
msgstr "使用此图像"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:620
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "备注"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:623
msgid "Redirect URI"
msgstr "重定向 URI"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:627
msgid "Login Button Shortcode"
msgstr "登录按钮短代码"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:631
msgid "Authentication URL Shortcode"
msgstr "身份验证 URL 短代码"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:636
msgid "Logs"
msgstr "日志"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:645
msgid "ICC.gg Sign-In for OpenID Connect - OpenID Connect SSO Plugin for WordPress"
msgstr "ICC.gg Sign-In for OpenID Connect - WordPress 的 OpenID Connect SSO 插件"

#. translators: %s: New version number.
#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:663
#, php-format
msgid "Update available: v%s"
msgstr "有可用更新：v%s"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:721
msgid "Choose Logo"
msgstr "选择徽标"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:724
msgid "Remove Logo"
msgstr "移除徽标"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:791
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:804
msgid "Enter your OpenID Connect identity provider settings."
msgstr "输入您的 OpenID Connect 身份提供程序设置。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:813
msgid "Modify the interaction between OpenID Connect and WordPress users."
msgstr "修改 OpenID Connect 与 WordPress 用户之间的交互。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:822
msgid "Control the authorization mechanics of the site."
msgstr "控制站点的授权机制。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:831
msgid ""
"Log information about login attempts through ICC.gg Sign-In for OpenID "
"Connect."
msgstr "记录通过 ICC.gg Sign-In for OpenID Connect 的登录尝试信息。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:846
msgid "Please enter a discovery URL."
msgstr "请输入发现 URL。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:855
msgid "Invalid discovery URL format."
msgstr "发现 URL 格式无效。"

#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:866
msgid "Discovery URL must use HTTPS in production environments."
msgstr "在生产环境中，发现 URL 必须使用 HTTPS。"

#. translators: %s: error message
#: includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:886
#, php-format
